// src/Central/FindingText.php, row 354
"The text sets an HTTP header which decides what browsers allow: Content-Security-Policy (CSP - which scripts and styles may run), CORS (which other sites may read the answers), Report-To and NEL (where the browsers of the visitors send their error reports), Referrer-Policy (to which sites the browsers send the address of the page). A status code or a content type is only a note (I)." => "Textul seteaz\xE3 un antet HTTP care decide ce permit browserele: Content-Security-Policy (CSP - ce scripturi si stiluri pot rula), CORS (ce alte site-uri pot citi r\xE3spunsurile), Report-To si NEL (unde trimit browserele vizitatorilor rapoartele de erori), Referrer-Policy (c\xE3ror site-uri le trimit browserele adresa paginii). Un cod de stare sau un tip de continut este doar o not\xE3 (I).", // ai 2026-10

// src/Central/FindingText.php, row 355
"Check that the CSP allows no scripts of foreign domains, that CORS is not opened to * unless the page is a public API, that Report-To and NEL send the reports to an address you trust, and that Referrer-Policy is neither unsafe-url nor no-referrer-when-downgrade. Security headers the site sets on purpose are fine - confirm them." => "Verificati c\xE3 CSP nu permite scripturi din domenii str\xE3ine, c\xE3 CORS nu este deschis pentru *, cu exceptia cazului \xEEn care pagina este un API public, c\xE3 Report-To si NEL trimit rapoartele la o adres\xE3 \xEEn care aveti \xEEncredere si c\xE3 Referrer-Policy nu este nici unsafe-url, nici no-referrer-when-downgrade. Anteturile de securitate setate intentionat de site sunt \xEEn regul\xE3 - confirmati-le.", // ai 2026-10

